        'Security Code Review — manual code review с focus на security: authentication/authorization logic audit (checking RBAC/ABAC implementation, JWT validation), cryptography usage review (avoiding ECB mode, proper key management), input validation analysis (allowlist vs blocklist, encoding/escaping), sensitive data handling (PII/PHI redaction, logging secrets), race conditions, business logic flaws',
        'Threat Modeling — structured approach к identification security risks: STRIDE methodology (Spoofing, Tampering, Repudiation, Information Disclosure, Denial of Service, Elevation of Privilege), attack trees, data flow diagrams (DFD), trust boundary analysis, conducting threat modeling sessions с product/dev teams',
        'Secure Coding Practices — знание secure development patterns: input validation/sanitization (parameterized queries для SQL injection prevention, HTML encoding для XSS), authentication best practices (bcrypt/Argon2 password hashing, MFA implementation, secure session management), authorization patterns (RBAC implementation, principle of least privilege), cryptography (using HTTPS/TLS, secure random number generation, proper encryption algorithms — AES-256-GCM, avoiding crypto mistakes), secure file handling (preventing path traversal, validating file types)',
