        'User Interviewing — проведение depth interviews 1-on-1 (30-90 минут): creating discussion guides (open-ended questions, probing techniques), active listening, building rapport, avoiding leading questions, transcription analysis (manual or via Otter.ai), thematic coding',
        'Usability Testing — moderated and unmoderated testing: creating test scenarios (realistic tasks), recruiting participants (screeners, incentives $50-150), facilitating sessions (think-aloud protocol), measuring metrics (task completion rate, time on task, SUS score System Usability Scale), analyzing findings, writing reports',
