        'Analytics Tools — product analytics platforms: Google Analytics 4 (event tracking, funnels, cohorts), Amplitude (user behavior analysis), Mixpanel (retention analysis), Hotjar/FullStory (session recordings, heatmaps), understanding key metrics (DAU/MAU, retention, conversion)',
