      'Conducting user interviews — facilitating depth interviews 1-on-1 (30-90 минут), using discussion guides, active listening, probing deeper с follow-up questions, creating safe space для honest feedback',
      'Usability testing — модерация тестовых сессий (think-aloud protocol, observing user struggles), running unmoderated remote tests через UserTesting.com/Maze, measuring SUS scores, task completion rates',
      'Survey design and analysis — crafting unbiased survey questions, distributing через Typeform/Qualtrics, analyzing responses (n=200-1000), identifying statistical significance, creating summary reports',
      'Analytics review — analyzing product data через Google Analytics/Amplitude/Mixpanel, reviewing heatmaps/session recordings (Hotjar/FullStory), identifying behavior patterns, quantifying user pain points',
      'Data synthesis — affinity mapping из десятков interview quotes, thematic analysis, identifying key insights и patterns, creating personas (data-driven), journey mapping',
      'Research reporting — writing clear research reports с executive summaries, creating presentation decks, using video clips from sessions, data visualization, presenting findings to stakeholders',
