      'Research repository management — organizing insights в Dovetail/Notion, tagging findings для searchability, creating research wikis, making past research accessible to team',
      'Workshop facilitation — facilitating collaborative sessions (journey mapping workshops, affinity mapping с cross-functional team), synthesis sessions, design sprints',
      'Continuous learning — staying updated с research methods, attending conferences (UXPA, ResearchOps Summit), reading research literature (Nielsen Norman Group, Baymard Institute), experimenting с new tools',
      'Ethics and compliance — ensuring informed consent от participants, anonymizing PII data, GDPR compliance, avoiding harm in research questions, transparency о том как data используется',
      'Advocacy для user-centric approach — pushing back против assumptions-based decisions, advocating для research budget, educating team about value of research, building research culture',
      'Scaling research practices — creating self-serve research tools (templates, screeners), training non-researchers в basic research methods (democratization of insights), building research ops processes',
