        'Repeating yourself — presenting same findings multiple times к different stakeholders, constant evangelism для importance of research, fighting assumptions-based decisions',
        'Isolation potential — в компаниях где вы solo researcher (единственный UXR на всю компанию), limited peer feedback, loneliness в decision-making, high pressure',
