    demand: `Спрос на Product Designers высокий и растущий — 1500-2500 вакансий "Product Designer" на hh.ru (Москва, СПб, remote), 8000-12000 вакансий глобально на LinkedIn. Product Designer стал mainstream роль в 2019-2024, replacing traditional "UX/UI Designer" titles в продуктовых компаниях. Спрос concentrated в product-driven companies: Яндекс (100 plus Product Designers across products), VK (30-50 PD), Avito, Ozon, Wildberries, Сбер (rebranding UX/UI roles к Product Designer с 2020 года), Тинькофф. Tech startups с product-market fit активно нанимают (Series A plus companies обычно имеют 2-5 Product Designers).

Зарплаты: Middle Product Designer 150-250K₽ (2-4 года experience, owning features independently), Senior 280-400K₽ (4-7 лет, complex initiatives, mentoring), Lead Product Designer 400-600K₽ (7-10 plus лет, managing small teams или leading design для major product area), Principal Designer 600K-1M₽ (10-15 plus лет, thought leadership, company-wide impact). Зарубежные компании платят significantly higher: Senior Product Designer $100-150K, Staff/Principal $150-220K. B2B SaaS companies (Miro, Notion, Figma) платят premium salaries.

Тренды: Product Designer становится standard роль вместо fragmented UX/UI titles — companies хотят holistic designers с product thinking, не только visual executors. AI integration в design workflow (Midjourney для concepts, ChatGPT для copywriting, Figma AI plugins) меняет work patterns — больше focus на strategy/thinking, меньше на mechanical tasks. Design systems maturity increasing — Product Designers expected to contribute к scalable component libraries. Metrics-driven design становится mandatory — showing ROI of design work через A/B tests, analytics. Remote/hybrid work normalized — 50-60% positions remote-friendly post-COVID.

Конкуренция: moderate-to-high — больше кандидатов чем 5 лет назад (UX/UI Designers transitioning к Product Designer роли), но also increased demand. Differentiators при hiring: demonstrated product impact (case studies showing metrics improvements), business acumen (understanding unit economics, business models), cross-functional collaboration experience (working с PM/Engineering тесно). Портфолио важно — companies хотят видеть не просто pretty designs, но process (research → ideation → testing → iteration → impact measurement).

Перспективы: excellent для experienced designers (4 plus years) transitioning от pure UX/UI. Challenging для entry-level (Junior Product Designer positions rare — обычно требуется 2-4 года UX/UI experience baseline). Growth opportunities strong: Product Designer → Senior PD → Lead/Principal (IC track 600K-1M₽) или Head of Design (management track, building design teams). Lateral transition к Product Management realistic (30% Product Designers eventually move к PM roles). International opportunities good — Product Design universal дисциплина, skills transferable globally (though presentation/communication skills в English критичны).`,
