    careerPath: `Junior SEO Specialist (6-12 месяцев) — entry-level роль learning SEO fundamentals: работа под supervision senior SEO (они reviewят your keyword research, проверяют technical recommendations before implementation, provide guidance), задачи tactical execution (keyword research using Яндекс.Wordstat/Ahrefs for assigned projects, on-page optimization — writing/optimizing meta titles/descriptions, content briefs для writers specifying target keywords/structure, basic technical audits using Screaming Frog identifying obvious issues — broken links/missing alt tags/duplicate titles), learning tools (obtaining Google Analytics Individual Qualification, mastering Google Search Console basics, getting comfortable Ahrefs/SEMrush interfaces exploring features), building foundational knowledge (understanding how search engines work — crawling/indexing/ranking fundamentals, learning on-page vs off-page vs technical SEO distinctions, studying Google Quality Rater Guidelines understanding what Google values), shadowing link building (observing senior specialists outreach campaigns, learning how identify link opportunities, writing draft outreach emails for review). Зарплата Junior: 70,000-110,000₽/мес. Признаки готовности к Middle: вы independently conduct keyword research projects, understand technical SEO beyond surface level, comfortable using professional tools без постоянной help, contributed measurable results — rankings improved, traffic increased on pages you optimized.

SEO Specialist / Middle SEO Specialist (2-4 года опыта) — самостоятельная роль с ownership projects: independent project management (owning SEO для specific site sections or smaller clients, planning quarterly initiatives, executing без constant oversight), comprehensive keyword strategies (conducting extensive keyword research — identifying opportunities across informational/commercial/transactional queries, creating keyword mapping spreadsheets assigning keywords к pages, balancing short-tail high-volume с long-tail easier-to-rank terms), technical SEO implementations (working с developers implementing fixes — canonical tags, structured data, XML sitemaps, explaining WHY changes needed, testing implementations post-launch via GSC/testing tools), content strategy development (creating detailed content briefs based на keyword research и competitor analysis, content gap analysis identifying topics competitors cover but you missing, pillar-cluster content models strengthening topical authority), link building campaigns (executing outreach campaigns — finding relevant websites, personalizing pitches, negotiating guest post placements, tracking acquired backlinks), reporting и analysis (monthly reporting showing rankings movement/traffic trends/backlinks acquired, diagnosing traffic fluctuations identifying causes — seasonality/algorithm updates/technical issues, presenting findings и recommendations stakeholders clearly). Зарплата Middle: 130,000-220,000₽/мес. Признаки готовности к Senior: you independently manage complex SEO projects start-to-finish, consistently deliver measurable results — significant traffic/rankings growth, deep expertise technical SEO able solve complex problems, mentor junior team members, propose strategic initiatives beyond tactical tasks.

Senior SEO Specialist (4-7 лет опыта) — экспертная роль с strategic impact: large-scale SEO management (owning SEO strategy для major sites — e-commerce thousands pages, media sites, enterprise websites, coordinating cross-functional teams developers/content/design), advanced technical SEO (solving complex technical problems — JavaScript rendering issues, international SEO hreflang implementation, large-scale site migrations preserving SEO value, progressive web apps SEO considerations, algorithm penalty recovery diagnosing causes и implementing comprehensive fixes), strategic link building (developing link acquisition strategies beyond basic outreach — digital PR campaigns earning editorial links, creating linkable assets — original research/tools/infographics, building relationships journalists/industry influencers, competitive link gap exploitation), data-driven optimization (advanced analytics — segmenting organic traffic by intent, cohort analysis understanding user journeys, ROI modeling projecting SEO investment returns, conversion rate optimization collaborating с CRO specialists improving landing pages), algorithm expertise (deep understanding Google algorithms — RankBrain machine learning, BERT natural language processing, Core Web Vitals impact, staying ahead updates predicting impacts, proactive adjustments), mentoring и knowledge sharing (training junior/middle SEO specialists, code-reviewing their strategies before implementation, conducting internal SEO workshops educating company, creating documentation processes/best practices), vendor management (evaluating SEO tools/agencies, managing external link building agencies if outsourcing, negotiating contracts). Зарплата Senior: 250,000-320,000₽/мес. Признаки готовности к Lead/Head: you manage multiple SEO specialists, make company-wide SEO strategy decisions, recognized externally as expert — speaking at conferences/publishing thought leadership, driving multi-million traffic impact.

Team Lead SEO / Head of SEO (7+ лет) — управленческая и стратегическая роль: team management (hiring/managing 3-10 SEO specialists, setting individual KPIs, performance reviews, career development, distributing workload efficiently across team), SEO strategy ownership (defining overall organic search strategy aligned с business goals, quarterly/annual roadmaps prioritizing initiatives, budget allocation across tools/agencies/content production/link building), stakeholder management (reporting to C-level executives — CEO/CMO — explaining SEO contribution to revenue, managing expectations about timelines/results, securing investment in SEO initiatives, defending SEO priorities against competing demands), cross-functional leadership (collaborating с Product on site architecture decisions impacting SEO, working с Engineering on technical implementations, partnering с Content strategy content roadmaps, coordinating с PR link acquisition opportunities), competitive intelligence (monitoring competitor SEO strategies identifying threats/opportunities, market positioning understanding where you stand vs competition organically, strategic responses maintaining competitive advantage), advanced analytics (cohort analysis understanding long-term organic traffic value, attribution modeling crediting SEO appropriately multi-touch journeys, forecasting organic growth scenarios informing business planning, ROI reporting proving SEO profitability), vendor strategy (managing relationships with SEO tool vendors, evaluating new technologies AI-powered SEO tools, negotiating enterprise contracts saving costs), thought leadership (representing company at industry events, publishing SEO content building personal brand, contributing to industry knowledge). Зарплата Lead/Head: 320,000-500,000₽/мес в России, $100-180K/год internationally. Potential path: VP Marketing overseeing all marketing channels not just SEO, Growth Lead focusing broader acquisition strategies, Consultant/Agency Founder leveraging expertise helping multiple clients.`,
