      'Local SEO Optimization — локальное продвижение: Google Business Profile management (claiming/verifying business listing, completing profile 100% — business info/categories/hours/photos, posting updates regularly — offers/events/news, responding to reviews promptly professionally building reputation), local citations building (ensuring NAP consistency — Name/Address/Phone — across directories — Яндекс.Справочник/2GIS/Yell.ru, submitting to relevant local directories/industry associations, monitoring citations accuracy correcting inconsistencies), local link building (earning links from local sources — local news sites/blogs/chambers of commerce, sponsoring local events/charities, partnerships local businesses cross-promotion), reviews management (encouraging satisfied customers leave Google/Яндекс reviews via email/SMS campaigns, responding professionally to negative reviews demonstrating customer care, monitoring review signals affecting local pack rankings), location pages (creating unique pages for multiple locations if applicable, avoiding duplicate content templating everything, including local testimonials/directions/local keywords)',
      'E-commerce SEO — оптимизация интернет-магазинов: product page optimization (writing unique product descriptions avoiding manufacturer copy duplicate across sites, optimizing titles — brand + model + key attributes, structured data Product schema showing price/availability/reviews in SERP, user-generated content reviews providing fresh content), category pages optimization (writing unique category descriptions including keywords naturally, faceted navigation handling — rel=canonical or noindex for filter combinations avoiding duplicate content, pagination strategy — rel=prev/next or view-all pages), technical e-commerce challenges (managing large inventories efficiently — thousands SKUs crawl budget optimization, handling discontinued products — 410 Gone vs 301 redirect to similar items, duplicate content similar products — variations handled via canonicals), internal linking strategy (linking related products cross-selling opportunities, category-to-product links distributing link equity, breadcrumbs improving navigation)',
      'Algorithm Update Monitoring — отслеживание обновлений алгоритмов: tracking updates rollout (following Google SearchLiaison Twitter/blog announcements, monitoring industry publications — Search Engine Land/Moz/SEMrush blogs, using rank tracking tools volatility features detecting large SERP fluctuations indicating updates), impact assessment (analyzing whether traffic/rankings drops/spikes correlate with update dates, identifying affected pages/queries, determining update type — Core Update broad quality assessment/Spam Update targeting manipulative tactics), diagnosing causes (if negatively impacted, analyzing what changed — content quality issues/backlink profile problems/technical deficiencies, comparing affected pages vs unaffected finding patterns), recovery implementation (addressing issues identified — improving content EAT signals/disavowing toxic links/fixing technical problems, patience waiting for Google re-crawl/re-assess site post-fixes, monitoring recovery progress over weeks/months), staying informed (subscribing to industry newsletters, participating SEO communities — Reddit r/SEO/forums, attending webinars/conferences learning from experts)',
      'Content Management Systems Work — работа с CMS: WordPress SEO (configuring Yoast SEO/Rank Math plugins correctly, optimizing permalink structure, managing categories/tags avoiding thin taxonomy pages, caching plugins setup improving performance, troubleshooting plugin conflicts affecting SEO), custom CMS optimization (working с developers implementing SEO best practices — clean URL structure/meta tag controls/XML sitemap generation/schema markup, ensuring CMS allows necessary customizations for SEO), page builders (optimizing Tilda/Wix/Shopify sites despite platform limitations, maximizing available SEO settings, understanding constraints vs custom solutions, workarounds for common builder SEO issues)',
      'International SEO — международная оптимизация: hreflang implementation (adding hreflang tags indicating language/region targeting — English for US vs UK vs Australia, avoiding duplicate content penalties multi-regional sites, validating hreflang using GSC International Targeting report), multi-regional strategy (deciding URL structure — ccTLDs vs subdirectories vs subdomains, understanding pros/cons each approach, consistent implementation across regions), localized content (ensuring content truly localized not just translated — local idioms/currency/examples, cultural relevance, hiring native speakers reviewing content), international link building (building backlinks from region-specific domains strengthening local authority, understanding regional link ecosystems differ — .ru links matter for Russia rankings)',
      'Site Migrations Planning — планирование переездов сайта: pre-migration preparation (comprehensive crawl documenting current site structure/URLs, exporting rankings/traffic data establishing baseline, creating complete redirect mapping old URLs → new URLs), redirect implementation (301 redirects preserving link equity, avoiding redirect chains degrading value, testing redirects thoroughly before launch using tools like Screaming Frog), post-migration monitoring (checking GSC coverage report identifying indexation issues, monitoring rankings/traffic for unexpected drops, responding quickly to issues — fixing broken redirects/updating sitemaps, communicating с stakeholders about normal temporary fluctuations vs problems requiring action)',
      'SEO Training и Knowledge Sharing — обучение и обмен знаниями: internal SEO training (conducting workshops educating content team/developers on SEO basics — keyword research/on-page optimization/technical requirements, creating documentation/guidelines reference materials, answering questions demystifying SEO for non-specialists), mentoring junior SEO specialists (reviewing their work providing constructive feedback, pairing on projects teaching advanced techniques, career guidance helping their growth), staying current (continuous learning via courses/certifications, reading industry publications, experimenting with new tactics documenting learnings, contributing to SEO community sharing knowledge via blogs/talks)',
