      'International companies remote roles — работа на зарубежные компании: higher compensation (US/EU companies paying $60-120K+ annually significantly higher than Russian rates ₽150-400K/мес equivalent, currency arbitrage opportunity), global exposure (working with international teams, English daily, exposure best practices Western SEO), remote-first culture (most international hires remote by design, асинхронная коммуникация, flexible hours accommodating timezones), advanced tools access (enterprise-level SEO platforms — Conductor/BrightEdge/seoClarity often unavailable Russia, cutting-edge martech stacks), challenges (timezone differences — meetings late evenings early mornings Moscow time, cultural adjustment communication styles, payment logistics sanctions affecting transfers)',
