    careerPath: `Junior SMM Specialist (3-9 месяцев) — entry-level роль learning social media fundamentals: работа под supervision senior SMM или SMM Manager (они approve your content calendars, review posts before publishing, guide strategy decisions), задачи tactical execution (creating posts daily/weekly following established content plan, responding comments/DMs timely maintaining community engagement, scheduling content using SMMplanner/Publer ahead publication, basic graphics creation Canva using templates brand guidelines, monitoring mentions/hashtags brand tracking conversations), learning platforms (deeply understanding primary platform focus — VK if Russian brand/Instagram if international/Telegram channels, exploring features experimenting formats — posts/stories/reels/clips, studying analytics basics reach/engagement interpreting performance), building portfolio (documenting work даже supervised — screenshot metrics/campaigns participated, creating case studies even junior contributions measurable results, developing personal brand demonstrating SMM skills own profiles). Зарплата Junior: 50,000-80,000₽/мес (часто ниже чем другие digital marketing roles reflecting lower entry barrier). Признаки готовности к Middle: вы independently manage content calendar without constant oversight, comfortable creating content start-to-finish minimal revisions, understand platform algorithms intuitively what works, contributed measurable community growth/engagement increase.

SMM Specialist / Middle SMM Specialist (1-3 года опыта) — самостоятельная роль with campaign ownership: independent content management (planning monthly content calendars balancing promotional/value-added content, creating all content types text/graphics/video without heavy supervision, publishing scheduling optimal times maximizing reach based analytics), strategy development (proposing content initiatives aligned business goals — increasing brand awareness/driving website traffic/generating leads, competitive analysis identifying differentiation opportunities, A/B testing content formats/captions/posting times data-driven optimization), advertising campaigns (launching managing targeted ads VK Ads/Telegram Ads setting budgets/targeting/creative, tracking campaign performance adjusting real-time improving ROI, reporting ad results stakeholders demonstrating value), community growth (implementing follower acquisition tactics — contests/collaborations/hashtag strategies, engaging authentically building relationships loyal community not just numbers, moderating discussions fostering positive environment), analytics ownership (tracking KPIs monthly reporting reach/engagement/conversions, identifying top-performing content doubling down winners, diagnosing issues sudden engagement drops/follower loss investigating causes), cross-functional collaboration (working с designers complex graphics beyond your Canva skills, briefing copywriters если separate role tone/messaging, coordinating customer service social inquiries requiring escalation). Зарплата Middle: 100,000-180,000₽/мес. Признаки готовности к Senior: you manage multiple social accounts/brands simultaneously, proven track record significant community growth/engagement, mentor junior SMM specialists, propose strategic initiatives beyond tactical posts.

Senior SMM Specialist (3-6 лет опыта) — экспертная роль strategic impact: multi-platform strategy (developing comprehensive social media strategy across VK/Telegram/OK/Instagram*/YouTube aligned overall marketing goals, platform-specific tactics playing each platform strengths, integrated campaigns consistent messaging adapted per platform maximizing reach), brand voice ownership (defining/evolving brand voice guidelines всего SMM content follows, training team members maintaining consistency, ensuring brand personality authentic resonates target audience), influencer partnerships (developing influencer marketing strategy identifying/vetting/negotiating collaborations, managing campaigns start-to-finish от briefing до performance analysis, building long-term relationships key influencers ongoing collaborations), crisis management leadership (leading crisis response social channels crafting statements managing backlash, monitoring brand reputation proactively identifying potential issues early, post-crisis analysis learnings preventing future occurrences), advanced analytics (cohort analysis understanding follower lifetime value, attribution modeling crediting social touchpoints conversions multi-channel journeys, predictive analytics forecasting trends informing strategy, competitive benchmarking understanding market positioning), team mentorship (training junior/middle SMM specialists best practices, reviewing team content providing constructive feedback, creating documentation/guidelines scaling SMM operations, knowledge sharing internal workshops), tool/platform expertise (staying cutting-edge new features/platforms emerging, testing beta features early-adopter advantage, recommending tools improving team efficiency). Зарплата Senior: 200,000-250,000₽/мес. Признаки готовности к Lead: you manage SMM team 2-5 people, make strategic decisions company social media presence, recognized industry expert speaking/writing sharing knowledge, driving significant business impact measurable revenue/brand awareness.

SMM Team Lead / Head of SMM (6+ лет) — управленческая и стратегическая роль: team management (hiring/managing 3-10 SMM specialists/designers/community managers, setting individual KPIs aligned business goals, performance reviews career development, workload distribution balancing capacity priorities), strategic planning (defining overall social media strategy aligned business objectives growth/brand building/customer acquisition, quarterly/annual roadmaps prioritizing initiatives, budget allocation platforms/ads/tools/agencies/content production), stakeholder communication (reporting C-level executives CMO/CEO social media contribution business metrics, managing expectations realistic timelines/results social media, securing investment SMM initiatives demonstrating ROI), cross-departmental collaboration (partnering Product social feedback product development, coordinating Customer Service social inquiry routing SLAs, working Sales social selling enablement, aligning PR crisis communication protocols), vendor management (managing relationships agencies/freelancers supplementing team capacity, evaluating social media tools/platforms subscribing, negotiating influencer partnerships strategic level), innovation leadership (experimenting emerging platforms early TikTok/Clubhouse analogues, piloting new content formats — live shopping/AR filters/interactive content, staying ahead trends identifying opportunities competitors missing), measurement framework (establishing KPIs measuring social media success — not just vanity metrics followers/likes but business outcomes traffic/leads/sales, attribution modeling understanding social contribution, ROI reporting proving social media profitability investments). Зарплата Lead/Head: 250,000-400,000₽/мес в России, $80-150K/год internationally. Potential path: CMO (Chief Marketing Officer) overseeing all marketing channels not just social, Brand Director focusing broader brand strategy, Agency Founder starting SMM agency leveraging expertise.`,
